Error: Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed: `data[…][…]` already has a live view that conflicts with `other`
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/write_subrange_reborrow_keeps_sibling_windows_exclusive.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     other: edit[0..<2].in_place()
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: Many read views may overlap, but an exclusive mutable view cannot overlap any other live view
 Fix: Finish using the earlier view before creating this one, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed
